+
+- `lib/runtime/app_runtime_status.dart` — Firebase and backend readiness only.
+- `lib/runtime/app_bootstrap.dart` — initializes Firebase, config, local
+  repositories, and learning dependencies; contains no Supabase import or
+  initializer.
+- `lib/runtime/app_dependencies.dart` — unchanged dependency container shape
+  except for the simplified runtime status it carries.
+- `lib/runtime/app_build_info.dart` — default public version/build identity.
+- `lib/runtime/supabase_client_config.dart` — deleted.
+
